=== estimated-timing-decoder.tsv ===
# Decoder windows (AVAssetReader time range, the excerpt export's path) with estimated and precise timing. Environment: simulator iPhone18,3, iOS 26.5 (23F77), Debug build, output at 1 % volume (quiet test runs); at the start: host load averages 2.42 2.69 2.90 (1, 5, 15 min), 1 simulators booted on the host when the test run started
